Package: sustainas
Type: Package
Title: Sustainability Analysis for Fisheries and Livelihood Assessment
Version: 0.1.2
Date: 2026-11-15
Authors@R: person("Weksi","Budiaji", email = "budiaji@untirta.ac.id", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: Provides tools to measure program sustainability.
    These include the Rapid Appraisal for Fisheries by Kavanagh and Pitcher(2004) <doi:10.14288/1.0074801>,
    the Sustainable Livelihood Analysis by Hahn et al. (2009) <doi:10.1016/j.gloenvcha.2008.11.002>, 
    and the Stakeholder Influence-Interest analysis by Bryson (2004) <doi:10.1080/14719030410001675722>. 
    The package also includes validity measures and uncertainty analysis.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5)
License: GPL-3
LazyData: TRUE
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
